Third-party code redistributed with this project
------------------------------------------------

winit 0.30.13 — https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit
Copyright the winit contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

A patched copy is vendored at forge-ide/vendor/winit-0.30.13/ and built in
place of the published crate. Six files are modified, for two changes, and each
carries the modification notice Apache 2.0 section 4(b) requires.
winit's own LICENSE is retained beside the source it covers.

  1. macOS drag-and-drop accepts the modern `NSPasteboardTypeFileURL`
     pasteboard format and not only the legacy `NSFilenamesPboardType`, which
     Apple deprecated in 10.13. Without it a drop that populates only the
     modern type — the thumbnail macOS shows after a screenshot, for one — is
     refused outright. Reading those types needs two objc2 features upstream
     does not enable, so the vendored manifest differs too.
       src/platform_impl/macos/window_delegate.rs
       Cargo.toml

  2. `ActiveEventLoopExtMacOS::set_dock_menu` is added, so an application can
     supply the menu shown when its Dock icon is right-clicked. AppKit asks
     only the application delegate for that menu and winit owns the delegate,
     so upstream provides no way to offer one.
       src/platform/macos.rs
       src/platform_impl/macos/app_state.rs
       src/platform_impl/macos/event_loop.rs
       src/platform_impl/macos/mod.rs

Both changes are intended to go upstream, and this vendored copy is intended
to be removed — it is the first dependency Forge plans to stop shipping. See
forge-ide/README.md.

No other third-party source is redistributed here. Everything else is fetched
by Cargo at build time under its own licence.
